                      "fill": "#A1A1AA",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "I hope you are doing well. My name is Mihir M Mirpuri and I am a Junior pursuing my ECE at Harvard University. I am interested in lala and would love to grab 10-15 minutes on the phone with you to hear about your experiences at Google.",
