                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ERI55",
                      "name": "tpPara2",
                      "fill": "#A1A1AA",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "In case it’s helpful to provide more context on my background, I have attached my resume below for your reference. I look forward to hearing from you.",
